## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/packages/
*.lock.json
!packages.lock.json

## Build artifacts
## NOTE: NOT "artifacts/" — that's the tracked Jupyter-notebook artifacts
## directory (see CLAUDE.md "Artifacts (Jupyter Notebooks)"), not build output.
## This project's actual build output goes to bin/ and obj/ (ignored above).
publish/
dist/

## Rider / JetBrains
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## VS Code
## NOTE: "/*" not a trailing-slash "/" — a directory-level pattern would block
## git from ever re-including files below it, silently breaking every "!" line here.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/.gitkeep

## Scratch space — contents are throwaway, but the folder itself is tracked.
tmp/*
!tmp/.gitkeep

## Android
*.apk
*.aab
local.properties

## User secrets & keys
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.Development.json
secrets.json

## SoundFont large files (store reference, not binary)
assets/soundfonts/*.sf2
assets/soundfonts/*.sf3

## Local debug/run artifacts (never meant to be committed)
*.binlog
run_out*.txt
run_err*.txt

# --- added by security audit patch (2026-07-08) ---
node_modules/
.env
.env.*
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
.wrangler/

## Claude memory mirror — deliberately NOT tracked in this repo.
## The mirror is cross-project (spans every project under this machine's
## H:\DEV grouping, not just Symphonia Legato), so committing it here leaked
## private client/business data into a public MIT repo (found + purged from
## history 2026-09-16 via git-filter-repo — see CHANGELOG.md). Keep the local
## folder for this machine's own use, but never re-track it.
claude_memory/
